# 8. A personality is made of bricks of two kinds (stack/personality/bricks.json).

direction: down

personality: "A personality\n(cautious, adventurous, ...)" {class: tier}

code: "Settings of the Pilot\ncode: always applied\ne.g. 2 cells at most in one move" {class: key; width: 330}
text: "Instructions to the Strategist's model\ntext: often followed, sometimes forgotten\ne.g. look around before every move" {class: part; width: 330}

rules: "The Referee's rules, underneath:\nno brick can loosen them" {class: never; width: 330}

personality -> code
personality -> text
code -> rules
text -> rules
